      "examples": "Set a texture in a compute program from a resource\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">go</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">property</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;my_texture&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">resource</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">texture</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n\n<span class=\"kr\">function</span> <span class=\"nf\">init</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">compute</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_textures</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;/my_compute.computec&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">my_texture</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">my_texture</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">})</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
